  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You tell your immediate surroundings how they should be arranged, and it is so.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Weaver of the Present, maximum hand size of 5 or higher,Wis 17</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you cast a greater portent that targets a single creature, you may spend 3 fate points to have that portent affect a second creature within 10 feet of the primary target. Both creatures must be legal targets for the portent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
